WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.905 --> 00:00:17.826
hair was wet from her bath.

2
00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.508
She heard a knock on her door.

3
00:00:21.569 --> 00:00:23.150
Vinnie came into her room.

4
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:26.693
"I need to talk to you," he said.

5
00:00:26.713 --> 00:00:33.593
"We can talk tomorrow," Mandy said sleepily.

6
00:00:33.613 --> 00:00:36.236
"It'll be too late.

7
00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:39.718
We have to talk now," Vinnie said.

8
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.220
Mandy sighed.

9
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.224
"Okay, what?"

10
00:00:46.244 --> 00:00:51.988
"Jordan and Scarlet are coming over tomorrow," Vinnie said.

11
00:00:52.008 --> 00:00:54.190
"Oh no!"

12
00:00:55.091 --> 00:00:55.751
she cried.

13
00:00:56.792 --> 00:01:01.056
Their cousins Jordan and Scarlet were seven-year-old twins.

14
00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.942
And they were completely wild!

15
00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.163
They loved to play hide-and-seek.

16
00:01:08.964 --> 00:01:14.147
But this game mostly involved poking around in other people's stuff.

17
00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:18.389
"What if they go in the attic?"

18
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:19.950
asked Vinnie.

19
00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:24.332
"We can't let them find the album!"

20
00:01:25.293 --> 00:01:26.354
Mandy whispered.

21
00:01:26.374 --> 00:01:30.536
"We have to hide it," said her brother.

22
00:01:31.812 --> 00:01:32.753
Mandy nodded.

23
00:01:34.074 --> 00:01:40.058
Quietly the children went up to the attic, and Mandy picked up the album.

24
00:01:41.138 --> 00:01:42.499
"Where should we put it?"

25
00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:43.700
she asked.

26
00:01:44.681 --> 00:01:45.721
She looked around.

27
00:01:46.802 --> 00:01:50.064
But now, Vinnie was thinking of something else.

28
00:01:50.084 --> 00:01:55.828
"Hey, let's take one more trip," he said.

29
00:01:57.129 --> 00:01:58.570
Mandy shook her head.

30
00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:01.532
"I'm too tired, Vinnie."

31
00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:10.340
"But with Jordan and Scarlet here," said Vinnie, "we may not be able to go for a while."

32
00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:15.563
"But I just had a bath," Mandy whined.

33
00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:18.785
"Come on, it'll be fun."

34
00:02:19.586 --> 00:02:21.987
Vinnie took the album from her hands.

35
00:02:23.068 --> 00:02:24.309
He opened it up.

36
00:02:25.449 --> 00:02:29.832
"Wow! Look at this," he said with excitement.

37
00:02:31.324 --> 00:02:34.865
The old man was standing inside a large arena.

38
00:02:36.145 --> 00:02:38.806
The seats were filled with cheering people.

39
00:02:39.986 --> 00:02:42.587
Behind the man was a long stage.

40
00:02:43.707 --> 00:02:47.068
Some things were glowing at the end of the stage.

41
00:02:50.989 --> 00:02:52.030
are those?"

42
00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.391
Vinnie pointed to the glowing objects.

43
00:02:55.411 --> 00:03:02.474
"I count two of them," Mandy said, looking carefully at the photo.

44
00:03:02.494 --> 00:03:04.755
"They look like fish."

45
00:03:04.775 --> 00:03:07.937
"Where do you think this is?"

46
00:03:08.758 --> 00:03:09.679
wondered Vinnie.

47
00:03:09.699 --> 00:03:17.364
"We'll soon find out," Mandy said, as the glowing light got brighter.

48
00:03:18.545 --> 00:03:22.968
The children's eyes closed as they fell down the dark tunnel.

49
00:03:27.611 --> 00:03:28.412
cried Vinnie.

50
00:03:28.904 --> 00:03:31.526
He banged his knee on something hard.

51
00:03:33.027 --> 00:03:37.949
Mandy landed right beside her brother in front of an arched doorway.

52
00:03:40.411 --> 00:03:44.053
As soon as they stood up, someone touched their arms.

53
00:03:45.514 --> 00:03:50.076
"Move along, children," said a man wearing a long white robe.

54
00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:52.958
"You must not block the entrance."

55
00:03:54.119 --> 00:03:59.219
The children moved aside as some men walked into the large building.

56
00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:04.143
"Wow!" Vinnie cried as he looked around.

57
00:04:04.163 --> 00:04:06.785
"Are we back in Greece?"

58
00:04:07.465 --> 00:04:08.186
asked Vinnie.

59
00:04:09.287 --> 00:04:12.169
Everything he saw reminded him of Greece.

60
00:04:12.189 --> 00:04:16.092
"I don't think so," said Mandy.

61
00:04:17.033 --> 00:04:19.275
She tried to look through the doorway.

62
00:04:19.295 --> 00:04:24.980
"Women and girls use the door on the side," the large man shouted.

63
00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:28.903
"You come with me, dear," said a woman.

64
00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:31.767
She grabbed Mandy's arm.

65
00:04:31.787 --> 00:04:36.572
"But but Mandy tried to explain.

66
00:04:37.953 --> 00:04:39.755
The woman led her away.
